[101.218, "o", "\u001b[1;35m\u23fa Claude\u001b[0m\r\n  Close to the target even split (21/23/20/20 out of 84 \u2014 a \"roughly a quarter each\" as required). Let's remove the te\r\n  mporary builder script from the scratchpad since it's not part of the deliverable.\r\n\r\n"]
